enchilada: sweetfb_fit=1 scales the iPhone X plane onto the panel

The 1125x2436 plane was shown 1:1 as its centred panel-sized part, which on
the 1080x2280 OnePlus 6 cuts 78 rows off the top and bottom (status bar, home
indicator). With sweetfb_fit=1 AppleCLCD scales the whole plane to fit
(nearest neighbour, aspect kept: 1052x2280 with black side bars) and SweetHID
maps touches back through the same transform. Off by default.

